            <ArticleTitle>Increased incidence and severity of Kawasaki disease among Filipino-Americans in San Diego county.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>909-11</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/INF.0b013e31821e52c6</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This study compared characteristics of Kawasaki disease (KD) in Filipino and non-Filipino children. Filipino KD patients had a higher coronary artery Z-score (P = 0.016) and aneurysm rate (P = 0.021) than KD patients of non-Filipino Asian and non-Asian descent.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
